### SınavPlan — elle deneme koleksiyonu (VS Code "REST Client" eklentisi)
### Önce `cp .env.example .env && docker compose up --build`. Demo parolası: Demo!1234
### Her bölümde önce ilgili rolle "login" isteğini çalıştırın; token otomatik kullanılır.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@password = Demo!1234
@json = application/json

############################################################ ALTYAPI
### Sağlık (veritabanı dahil)
GET {{host}}/health

### Prometheus metrikleri
GET {{host}}/metrics

### Swagger UI için tarayıcıda: http://localhost:8080/docs
GET {{host}}/openapi.yaml

############################################################ KİMLİK (5 rol)
### secretary — Bölüm sekreteri
# @name loginSecretary
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"email": "sekreter@sinavplan.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

###
@secretary = {{loginSecretary.response.body.access_token}}
@secretaryRefresh = {{loginSecretary.response.body.refresh_token}}

### lecturer — Öğretim üyesi
# @name loginLecturer
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"email": "hoca@sinavplan.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

###
@lecturer = {{loginLecturer.response.body.access_token}}

### invigilator — Gözetmen
# @name loginInvigilator
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"email": "gozetmen@sinavplan.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

###
@invigilator = {{loginInvigilator.response.body.access_token}}

### student_affairs — Öğrenci işleri
# @name loginAffairs
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"email": "ogrenciisleri@sinavplan.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

###
@affairs = {{loginAffairs.response.body.access_token}}

### student — Öğrenci
# @name loginStudent
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"email": "ogrenci@sinavplan.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

###
@student = {{loginStudent.response.body.access_token}}

### Yanlış parola -> 401
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"email": "sekreter@sinavplan.test", "password": "yanlis"}

### Oturum sahibi
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

### Refresh (rotasyon: eski token iptal olur, tekrar kullanılırsa tüm zincir iptal)
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"refresh_token": "{{secretaryRefresh}}"}

### Çıkış
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"refresh_token": "{{secretaryRefresh}}"}

############################################################ YETKİ (401 / 403)
### Token yok -> 401
GET {{host}}/students

### Öğrenci, öğrenci listesini göremez -> 403
GET {{host}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

### Öğrenci BAŞKASININ programını göremez -> 403
GET {{host}}/students/2/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

############################################################ F-1 CSV İÇE AKTARMA
### Öğrenciler (satır bazlı hata raporu; aynı dosya tekrar yüklenince created=0)
POST {{host}}/imports/students
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}
Content-Type: text/csv

student_no,full_name,department_code,disability
990001,Deneme Öğrenci,BLM,false
990002,Engelli Deneme,ELK,true
9,Hatalı Numara,BLM,false
990003,Bilinmeyen Bölüm,XXX,false

### Dersler
POST {{host}}/imports/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}
Content-Type: text/csv

code,name,department_code,year,requires_lab
TST101,Deneme Dersi,BLM,1,false

### Şubeler
POST {{host}}/imports/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}
Content-Type: text/csv

course_code,section_code,lecturer_email
TST101,A,hoca@sinavplan.test

### Kayıtlar
POST {{host}}/imports/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}
Content-Type: text/csv

student_no,course_code,section_code
990001,TST101,A

############################################################ F-2 SALONLAR
### Liste (keyset: ?limit=&after=) — laboratuvarlar
GET {{host}}/rooms?type=lab&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{lecturer}}

### Salon + koltuk düzeni
GET {{host}}/rooms/1
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

### Salon oluştur (satır, sütun; pasif ve erişilebilir koltuklar [satır, sütun])
# @name newRoom
POST {{host}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"code": "DEMO-1", "building": "Z", "floor": 1, "type": "classic", "rows": 4, "cols": 6,
 "inactive_seats": [[3, 5]], "accessible_seats": [[0, 0], [0, 2]]}

###
@roomId = {{newRoom.response.body.id}}

### Salonu güncelle (kullanılmıyorsa düzen de değişebilir)
PUT {{host}}/rooms/{{roomId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"code": "DEMO-1", "building": "Z", "floor": 2, "type": "classic", "rows": 4, "cols": 6,
 "inactive_seats": [], "accessible_seats": [[0, 0], [0, 2]]}

### Salonu sil (çizelgede kullanılıyorsa 409)
DELETE {{host}}/rooms/{{roomId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

############################################################ F-3 TAKVİM (asenkron)
### Dönemler
# @name periods
GET {{host}}/periods
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

###
@periodId = {{periods.response.body.items[0].id}}

### Takvim oluşturmayı başlat -> 202 + iş kimliği (T-1..T-4 zinciri arka planda)
# @name createSchedule
POST {{host}}/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"period_id": {{periodId}}, "seed": 42, "iterations": 300000}

###
@jobId = {{createSchedule.response.body.job_id}}

### İş durumu/sonucu (queued -> running -> succeeded | failed; başarısızsa çözümsüzlük raporu)
# @name job
GET {{host}}/schedule-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

###
@scheduleId = {{job.response.body.schedule_id}}

### Sürümler
GET {{host}}/schedules?period_id={{periodId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

### Sürüm ve kalite metrikleri (ceza, salon sayısı, gözetmen adaleti)
GET {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

### Yayınla (Idempotency-Key: aynı anahtarla tekrar aynı yanıtı verir)
POST {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}
Idempotency-Key: publish-{{scheduleId}}

############################################################ F-4 SALON VE OTURMA PLANI
### Takvim (keyset)
# @name calendar
GET {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/exams?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{lecturer}}

###
@examId = {{calendar.response.body.items[0].exam_id}}
@slotId = {{calendar.response.body.items[0].slot_id}}

### Bir slottaki salon planı
GET {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/rooms?slot_id={{slotId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

### Bir sınavın oturma planı (öğretim üyesi yalnız kendi dersini görür)
GET {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/seating?exam_id={{examId}}&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

############################################################ F-5 GÖZETMEN
### Görevler
# @name duties
GET {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/invigilators?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

###
@dutyUser = {{duties.response.body.items[0].user_id}}

### Gözetmen hastalandı: çıkar ve minimum değişiklikle yeniden hesapla (diğer atamalar kilitli)
POST {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/invigilators/{{dutyUser}}/remove
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}
Idempotency-Key: remove-{{scheduleId}}-{{dutyUser}}

### Gözetmenin kendi görevleri
GET {{host}}/me/duties
Authorization: Bearer {{invigilator}}

############################################################ F-6 MAZERET VE ÇAKIŞMA
### Öğrenci: sınav için mazeret
# @name studentExcuse
POST {{host}}/excuses
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"exam_id": {{examId}}, "reason": "Hastane raporum var"}

###
@excuseId = {{studentExcuse.response.body.id}}

### Gözetmen: slot için mazeret (onaylanırsa sonraki çizelgelerde T-4 kısıtı olur)
POST {{host}}/excuses
Authorization: Bearer {{invigilator}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"slot_id": {{slotId}}, "reason": "Başka sınavda görevliyim"}

### Öğrenci işleri: bekleyen mazeretler
GET {{host}}/excuses?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{affairs}}

### Karar (Idempotency-Key destekli; karara bağlanmış mazeret 409)
POST {{host}}/excuses/{{excuseId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{affairs}}
Idempotency-Key: decide-{{excuseId}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"decision": "approved", "note": "Rapor doğrulandı"}

### Kendi mazeretlerim
GET {{host}}/me/excuses
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

### Çizelge çakışmaları: aynı gün birden çok sınavı olan öğrenciler
GET {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/conflicts?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{affairs}}

############################################################ F-7 YOKLAMA VE SINAV KARTI
### Öğrencinin kendi programı (salon ve koltuk dahil)
# @name myExams
GET {{host}}/me/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

###
@myExam = {{myExams.response.body.items[0].exam_id}}

### Sınav kartı (tek kullanımlık QR; her çağrı eskisini iptal eder)
# @name card
POST {{host}}/me/exams/{{myExam}}/card
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

###
@qr = {{card.response.body.qr_token}}

### Gözetmen kartı okutur -> 200; ikinci okutma -> 409 qr_already_used
POST {{host}}/attendance/qr
Authorization: Bearer {{invigilator}}
Idempotency-Key: scan-{{qr}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"token": "{{qr}}", "device_id": "tablet-demo"}

### Çevrimdışı cihazın toplu senkronu (event_id UUIDv7; tekrar gelenler yok sayılır)
POST {{host}}/attendance/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{invigilator}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"events": [
  {"event_id": "0191a2b3-c4d5-7e6f-8a9b-0c1d2e3f4a5b", "device_id": "tablet-demo", "exam_id": {{myExam}}, "student_id": 1,
   "status": "present", "source": "manual", "hlc": {"wall": 1790000000000, "counter": 0}}
]}

### Sınavın yoklama durumu ve özeti
GET {{host}}/exams/{{myExam}}/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

### Yoklama çakışmaları (iki cihaz farklı durum bildirdi)
GET {{host}}/attendance/conflicts?exam_id={{myExam}}
Authorization: Bearer {{affairs}}

############################################################ T-5 TAHLİYE (toplu salon değişikliği)
### Bir slotta bir salonun tüm öğrencilerini başka salona taşı (Idempotency-Key destekli)
### from_room_id / to_room_id: yukarıdaki "salon planı" yanıtından seçin
POST {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/room-change
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}
Idempotency-Key: evacuate-demo-1
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"slot_id": {{slotId}}, "from_room_id": 1, "to_room_id": 2, "reason": "yangın tatbikatı"}

############################################################ FAZ 11: FARK YARATAN ÖZELLİKLER
### Excel / CSV / iCal (tarayıcıda dosya olarak iner)
GET {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/export?format=xlsx
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

###
GET {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/export?format=csv
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

###
GET {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/calendar.ics
Authorization: Bearer {{lecturer}}

### Öğrencinin kendi sınavları (salon + koltuk) ve gözetmenin görevleri
GET {{host}}/me/exams.ics
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

###
GET {{host}}/me/duties.ics
Authorization: Bearer {{invigilator}}

### Hızlı simülasyon: T-1'i KAYDETMEDEN çalıştırır, yayındaki sürümle kıyaslar
POST {{host}}/schedules/simulate
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"period_id": {{periodId}}, "seed": 7, "iterations": 50000}

### Etkinlik akışı (denetim kaydından)
GET {{host}}/activity?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

### Dönem slotları (editör hedefleri)
# @name slots
GET {{host}}/periods/{{periodId}}/slots
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

###
@slotId2 = {{slots.response.body.items[1].id}}

### Sürükle-bırak editörün API'si: önce dry_run (yazmaz), sonra gerçek taşıma (yeni TASLAK sürüm)
POST {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/exams/{{examId}}/move
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"slot_id": {{slotId2}}, "dry_run": true}

###
POST {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/exams/{{examId}}/move
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{"slot_id": {{slotId2}}}

### Faz 22 B3: yoğunluk haritası (SQL toplamı = çözücü metriği) ve "bu sınav neden burada?"
GET {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/load
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

###
GET {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/exams/{{examId}}/why
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

### Faz 22 B2: önizleme — gözetmen çıkarılırsa ne olur? (işlem koşar, geri alınır; veri değişmez)
POST {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/invigilators/3/remove?dry_run=true
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

### Faz 22 A2: kanıtlar — T-1..T-5 kurallarını kayıtlı plan üzerinde bağımsız SQL ile denetler (yazmaz)
GET {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/proofs
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

### Faz 22 A3: komut paleti araması (öğrenci no/ad, ders, salon) ve Öğrenci 360
GET {{host}}/search?q=2026000
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

###
GET {{host}}/students/1/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

### Faz 22 B1: aynı gün iki sınavı olan öğrenci için çözüm önerisi (yazmaz; uygulamak için yukarıdaki move)
GET {{host}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/fix-suggestions?student_id=2&limit=3
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}

###
### İki sürümü karşılaştır
GET {{host}}/schedules/compare?a=1&b=2
Authorization: Bearer {{secretary}}
